description: RigorRun project rules — positioning source of truth, claims ledger, protected paths
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. Before any task read `docs/context/POSITIONING.md`,
`docs/context/CLAIMS.md` and `docs/context/PROGRESS.md`. RigorRun is pre-deployment permission &
scope tests for AI agents; Stripe is only the first qualified pack. Never state a BUILDING or
NOT_BUILT claim as fact (`pnpm claims` must pass). Never edit `reports/**`, `docs/context/CLAIMS.md`
or `docs/context/POSITIONING.md`. Files under `docs/archive/**` or with an ARCHIVED banner are
history, not instructions.
